 <section class="white-box about-project" id="about-project" aria-labelledby="about-project-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-project-heading">About H Rishabraj Phoenix, Borivali West by H Rishabraj Builders and Developers</h2>
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>H Rishabraj Phoenix, a luxurious residential project located in Borivali West, offers an ideal blend of comfort, convenience, and connectivity. With its proximity to New Link Road (just 0.6 km away) and Swami Vivekanand Road (1.3 km away), this project ensures that residents have easy access to essential amenities, shopping, and entertainment options.</p><p>The project boasts of state-of-the-art amenities, including a Swimming Pool for sports enthusiasts, and Power Backup for added convenience. Additionally, the Master Bedroom features Walls with Oil Bound Distemper for a superior living experience. With RERA Registration No. P51800033878, H Rishabraj Phoenix is a reliable and compliant project that offers a secure and peaceful living environment.</p><p>As you embark on your journey to own a home, H Rishabraj Phoenix provides you with the perfect opportunity to create lifelong memories. For detailed information about the project, kindly refer to the Project Knowledge Pdf available at https://doc.squareyards.com/ProjectKnowledge/181152-h-rishabraj-phoenix-1396.pdf</p><strong>Available Unit Options</strong><p>The following table outlines the available unit options at H Rishabraj Phoenix:</p><div class=tablesResponsive><table width=100% border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=5><tbody><tr><td>Unit Type</td><td>Area (Sq. Ft.)</td></tr><tr><td>3 BHK Apartment</td><td>849 Sq. Ft.</td></tr><tr><td>3 BHK Apartment</td><td>1175 Sq. Ft.</td></tr><tr><td>3 BHK Apartment</td><td>1275 Sq. Ft.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><strong>Nearby Landmarks</strong><p>The residential property is strategically located near several notable landmarks, providing residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also offer a unique blend of convenience and comfort.</p><ul><li>Shanti Ashram bus stop is only 0.24 km away, making it easily accessible.</li><li>Bima Nagar Education Society School And Jr College is just 0.16 km away, ideal for families with children.</li><li>Lotus Multispeciality Hospital Borivali W is 0.37 km away, ensuring timely medical attention in case of an emergency.</li><li>Lenskart.Com At Ic Colony clinic is 0.54 km away, providing a convenient medical facility.</li><li>Zaika Fun Dining | Club Aquaria restaurant is just 0.06 km away, perfect for dining and entertainment.</li><li>Uplift Fitness Studio gym is 0.44 km away, allowing residents to stay fit and active.</li><li>St. Rocks College is 0.47 km away, providing higher education opportunities.</li><li>Arvindbhai Khatri Sons clothing store is 0.77 km away, allowing residents to shop for their daily needs.</li><li>Lic Shiv Mandir temple is 0.31 km away, providing a sense of community and spirituality.</li><li>99 Pancakes I.C. Colony Borivali food joint is 0.54 km away, offering a range of food options.</li><strong>Listing Information</strong><p>We have total 5 options available in H Rishabraj Phoenix for resale and rental, In resale we have 2 properties available ranging from 3 BHK having sizes from  3.30 CR -  23.00 CR </p><p>For rent you can check 3 properties having options for 1 BHK - 2 BHK with price ranging from  30000 -  50000.</p><div class=tablesResponsive><table width=100% border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=5><tbody><tr><td>Listing Type</td><td>Total Listings</td><td>Unit Type Range</td><td>Price Range</td></tr><tr><td>Resale</td><td>2</td><td>3 BHK</td><td> 3.30 CR -  23.00 CR</td></tr><tr><td>Rental</td><td>3</td><td>1 BHK - 2 BHK</td><td> 30000 -  50000</td></tr></tbody></table></div><strong>Govt. Registered Recent Transactions</strong><p>In the residential property market, a steady trend has emerged over the past three months, with a current rate of  26,007 and 3 sales transactions valued at  15 Cr, resulting in a price movement of - 698. Looking at the six-month aggregation, rental rates remain stagnant at N/A, yet the current rate stays the same at  26,007, with 8 sales transactions worth  29 Cr and a price movement of + 1,089. Analyzing the 1-year period, a consistent rate of  26,007 persists, accompanied by 11 sales transactions totaling  40 Cr, illustrating a noticeable price movement albeit undisclosed. These government-registered transactions provide valuable insights into the market dynamics and demonstrate a high level of activity in the area.</p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

      </section>



      
