      <div class="tab-content recent-updates " role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-recent-updates" id="panel-recent-updates" hidden>
        <h3 class="sr-only">Recent Updates</h3>
        <p class="tab-description"> Get the latest price and market updates for H Rishabraj Phoenix. </p>
        <div class="recent-updates-box">
            <time class="recent-updates-date"> Last update: Sep 2026 </time>
          <ol class="updates-list">
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Sep 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">Mumbai&#39;s Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">Mumbai&#39;s water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Jun 2026 </time>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">During Q2&#39;2026, average property prices for H Rishabraj Phoenix moved from ₹ 30,900/sqft to ₹ 44,200/sqft, reflecting a 43.04% rise.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> May 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">MMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Apr 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">The BMC&#39;s FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city&#39;s water supply capacity.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Apr 2026 </time>
              
              <h4 class="updates-list-heading">Mumbai-Pune Expressway &#39;Missing Link&#39; Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel</h4>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">The highly anticipated &#39;Missing Link&#39; project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Dec 2025 </time>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">During Q4&#39;2025, average property prices for H Rishabraj Phoenix moved from ₹ 30,300/sqft to ₹ 31,000/sqft, reflecting a 2.31% rise.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> May 2025 </time>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">External Works has reached 90%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 85% done.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Mar 2025 </time>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">External Works has reached 25%, Internal finishing stands at 43%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 45% done.</p>
            </li>
            
            <li class="updates-list-item">
              <time class="updates-list-date"> Nov 2024 </time>
              
              <p class="updates-list-description">External Works has reached 10%, Internal finishing stands at 38%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 40% done.</p>
