 <section class="white-box frequently-asked-questions" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
          <span class="section-label">FAQs</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="faq-heading">Frequently Asked Questions About H Rishabraj Phoenix</h2>
          <div class="faq-box">
            
            <article class="faq-item active">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-answer-1">What are the key features of H Rishabraj Phoenix? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-1">
                <p>H Rishabraj Phoenix offers amenities such as a swimming pool, power backup, 24 x 7 security, a central green park, and indoor games, ensuring a comfortable and enjoyable living experience.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2">Who is responsible for the development of H Rishabraj Phoenix? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-2">
                <p>The project is being developed by H Rishabraj Builders and Developers, who have a portfolio of 40 projects.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3">Is H Rishabraj Phoenix registered with RERA? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-3">
                <p>Yes, H Rishabraj Phoenix is RERA-registered under the registration number P51800033878.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4">What is the status of construction at H Rishabraj Phoenix? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-4">
                <p>The construction of H Rishabraj Phoenix is currently at the mid-stage.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5">How far is H Rishabraj Phoenix from essential services and landmarks? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-5">
                <p>H Rishabraj Phoenix is conveniently located near various essential services, with a school just 0.16 km away, a hospital 0.37 km away, and a restaurant only 0.06 km away.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-6">What types of apartment configurations are available in H Rishabraj Phoenix? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-6" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-6">
                <p>The project features 3 BHK apartments with sizes ranging from 849 sq. ft. to 1275 sq. ft.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
            <article class="faq-item">
              <h3 class="faq-header">
                <button type="button" id="faq-question-7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-7">What is the expected price range for units in H Rishabraj Phoenix? <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span> </button>
              </h3>
              <div class="faq-body" id="faq-answer-7" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-question-7">
                <p>The price range for rental units in H Rishabraj Phoenix is between 30,000 to 50,000, while resale units are listed from 3.30 crore to 23.00 crore.</p>
              </div>
            </article>
            
          </div>
      </section>


