  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization","name":"Square Yards","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","contentUrl":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","caption":"Square Yards"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo"},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"M3M Urbana Business Park, 1st Floor, Tower A, Sector 67","addressLocality":"Gurgaon","addressRegion":"Haryana","postalCode":"122102","addressCountry":"IN"},"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"connect@squareyards.com","availableLanguage":"en"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/SquareYards","https://www.linkedin.com/company/square-yards","https://www.youtube.com/@Square_Yards","https://www.instagram.com/square_yards/"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","name":"Square Yards","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en-IN"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/h-rishabraj-builders-and-developers-projects/10569/builder#organization","name":"H Rishabraj Builders and Developers","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/h-rishabraj-builders-and-developers-projects/10569/builder","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/h-rishabraj-builders-and-developers-10569.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/h-rishabraj-builders-and-developers-10569.jpg","caption":"H Rishabraj Builders and Developers developer logo"},"description":"H Rishabraj Builders and Developers, based in Mumbai, is an esteemed real estate project developer led by the visionary Mr. Harrish Kumar Jain. With a strong lineage in entrepreneurship and philanthropy, Mr. Jain has successfully carved a niche for his company in the redevelopment space.Having gained valuable experience in the textile business, Mr. Jain recognized the immense potential in the redevelopment of societies, which prompted him to embark on this new venture. Fuelled by his family values of commitment and dedication, he has effortlessly delivered more than 50 projects to the delight of both existing and new customers within just a decade.Mr. Jain extraordinary business acumen, technical proficiency, and exceptional networking skills have propelled the company towards an outstanding track record. Every project undertaken by H Rishabraj Builders and Developers reflects a deep understanding of the needs and desires of families, as they aim to create comfortable and lavish homes that bring joy to their residents.Considering his fierce leadership qualities and unwavering drive to uphold industry standards, it is no surprise that Mr. Jain has become the Founder member of the prestigious Brihanmumbai Developers Association BDA. In an impressively short span of 5 months, the association has garnered more than 700 members, underlining Mr. Jain dedication to representing developers and resolving complex issues faced in the redevelopment sector, working effortlessly with various levels of government and bureaucracy.H Rishabraj Builders and Developers embodies a passionate commitment to excellence and the guaranteed satisfaction of their clientele. With their unwavering dedication, technical prowess, and compassionate understanding of families aspirations, they continue to raise the benchmarks of the real estate industry in Mumbai. As listed on Square Yards, H Rishabraj Builders and Developers has 45 total projects, of which 26 are delivered."},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/h-rishabraj-phoenix/181152/project#primaryimage","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/i